	(text "The video card V2.0, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Bus and ports BUS INTERFACE, PORT DECODE, CONTROL AND STATUS (PA-PE)\n  sheet 3  CRTC         6845 CRTC ON PORTS PA (ADDRESS) / PB (DATA)\n  sheet 4  Text         BOARD SELECT ($D000 BLOCK), TEXT RAM $D000-$D7FF, CHARACTER GENERATOR, TEXT DOT SHIFTER\n  sheet 5  Clocks       DOT CLOCK, CHARACTER COUNTER (DOTS: 6 OR 8 DOTS A CHARACTER)\n  sheet 6  Graphics     GRAPHICS RAM $D800-$DFFF: SLOT MODE (GFX-ON = 1) / DIRECT MODE (GFX-ON = 0)\n  sheet 7  Video out    DOT COMBINE AND VIDEO OUT (GRAPHICS ONLY IN 8-DOT MODE)\n  sheet 8  PS2          PS/2: ATMEGA328P, LATCHES ON PD / PE, FTDI, -INT, RESET\n  sheet 9  Power        POWER UNITS, DECOUPLING, POWER LED, SPARE GATES\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, and the local label at each pin names the net\n(/NAME, the names on the board). Above the dashed line: the nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left:\nit reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: the nets drawn on that sheet only, a pin on each side\n(KiCad's ERC counts a root label as connected only when another label of its name is on the root sheet).\nVCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eed33491-d738-5687-8a8b-a349a97683dc"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
